"},{"d":"Mike was the ultimate loser.\n\nTwenty-three tournaments. Twenty-three first-round losses. A childhood sweetheart who secretly slept with his best friend for over a year. When he finally caught them, they didn’t even pretend to feel guilty — they laughed at him and called him weak.\n\nThat night should have broken him.\n\nInstead, it became the last day he lived as a loser.\n\nFor the past year, Mike had been hiding a secret. A System. While everyone still saw him as the same pathetic failure, he had been training in silence, rewriting his body, his skills, and his mindset. The prestigious S-University didn’t accept him out of pity — he earned his place by knocking out every opponent who stood in his way.\n\nNow the real story begins.\n\nWith the System guiding him, Mike starts taking everything he was denied. Women who once wouldn’t glance at him. Rivals who looked down on him. Status, strength, and desire.\n\nEve. Mia. And many more.\nThis time, he won’t ask for respect.\nHe’ll take it.","t":"From Loser to Dominator [LTD]","u":[{"_id":"G4xc6SmMhcJyeL4Ty","n":"kdaddy"}],"w":23148,"i":["https://cdn6.fiction.live/file/fictionlive/52dc0131-8ba0-4bb1-b1f4-d17a793e6633.jpg"],"likeCount":3,"contentRating":"teen","ta":["smut"],"cht":1789903670969,"ut":1789903671744,"_id":"fdqaqm8EsKQxZbPmm"},{"d":"Protector of Smiles and Demigod Dragonette","i":["https://cdn6.fiction.live/file/fictionlive/6992754e-a9b0-4469-9b92-5174d34777af.jpg"],"likeCount":69,"ta":["smileprotection","dragongirls","onigirls","foxgirls","familyslashharem","yakuza","demigods","shonen","shojoai","blood","magic","shinto","koshinto","ridiculouspowerlevels","overthetop","comfy","pregnancy","annoyingsuffixes","cosplay","foregoneconclusion","emotionalcontent","destroyingcities","killinggods","parthenogenesis"],"cht":1789156438185,"p":67718,"isLive":false,"t":"Ryukuza Quest","u":[{"a":"https://ddx5i92cqts4o.cloudfront.net/images/1cfpn1mu7_Avatar_400x400.jpeg","_id":"GkMKszfiDLfMygGwC","n":"xiombargsstor